1976,69,82,27],[33740,22.9,1976,68,84,26]],"links":[["Clearwater County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/minnesota/clearwater-county"],["ARC or PLC in Clearwater County","/arc-plc/minnesota/clearwater-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 15 grids October to November came in under 90% of normal in 38 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025 that same middle saw January to February at 61% and March to April at 133%. So far in 2026, April to May came in at 64% on the middle of the grids. Every grid listed had its driest year in 1976, with grid 32539 at 48%.</p>"}
